-- title:
--   Finite type of the two chart algebras over ℤ₍ₚ₎
-- statement:
--   Let $p$ be a prime and let $R$ denote the subring [`GaloisRep.ratLocalizedAt p`](def/GaloisRep_Flat.html#L8) of $\mathbb{Q}$ consisting of those rationals whose denominator is coprime to $p$ (so $R=\mathbb{Z}_{(p)}$). Let $\Gamma\le \mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$ be a subgroup of finite index containing $T=\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\0&1\end{pmatrix}$, and let $F=$ [`ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ Γ`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L101) be the intermediate field of $\mathbb{Q}((q))=$ `LaurentSeries ℚ` generated over $\mathbb{Q}$ by all quotients $f/g$ of the rational Laurent series attached to integral $q$-expansions of two modular forms of some common weight $k$ for $\Gamma$ (with the denominator series nonzero). Let $j\in F$ be nonzero and such that its image in $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ is [`ModularCurve.jqModC ℚ`](def/ModularCurve_JqCoeff.html#L15), namely $q^{-1}$ times the image of the integral power series `jNum` $=E_4^3\cdot$ `dedekindEtaUnitInv`. Then both of the following $R$-algebras are of finite type: the subalgebra of $F$ of elements integral over $R[j]$ (`chartAlgFin`), and the subalgebra of $F$ of elements integral over $R[j^{-1}]$ (`chartAlgInf`), where $R[j]$, $R[j^{-1}]$ denote the $R$-subalgebras of $F$ generated by $j$, resp. $j^{-1}$.
--
--   These two subalgebras are the chart rings of the two-chart integral model of the modular curve attached to $\Gamma$ over $\mathbb{Z}_{(p)}$, obtained by glueing the normalisations of the $j$-line and the $j^{-1}$-line inside the $q$-expansion function field; the present statement is the finiteness of integral closure input for that model, with no hypothesis relating $p$ to the level of $\Gamma$. It is used downstream in the analysis of the model for the groups $\Gamma_H$, for instance in the computation of minimal primes of its chart algebras, in reducedness statements modulo integers, and in the identification of valuation subrings at the cusps.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_finiteType_chartAlgFin_and_chartAlgInf_twoChartIntegralModel_qExpFunctionFieldC.lean

